10146 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Cafes today are not only places to eat but also social spaces where people interact\054 work\054 and spend time together\056\n\nWith the increasing integration of technology in dining environments\054 interactive digital tables are emerging as a new way to enhance ordering\054 engagement\054 and user experience\056\n\nThis project explores how human factors such as ergonomics\054 cognitive load\054 and social behavior influence the design of an interactive dining table for modern cafes\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 10147 0 R
     /Pg 316 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
